WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.209
[Upbeat music]

00:00:01.209 --> 00:00:03.086
- [Adam Lefkoe:] Underrated. Lefkoe!

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.547
Hot route.

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:07.340
Darrell Henderson! Hike!

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.343
[Suspenseful music]

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:15.223
[Laughing]

00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:17.100
I'm worried that the camera's exploded.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.186
[Instrumental music]

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:30.196
- Oh, what is up? What is good?

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.281
How ya livin'? How ya feelin'?

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:33.742
This is "Underrated." I am Adam Lefkoe.

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:36.369
This is the first show ever
that allows NFL players

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.871
to improve their Madden ratings.

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:40.206
It's brought to you by State Farm

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.624
and their surprisingly great rates.

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:43.418
Today, I got off the couch.

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:45.837
I came to California to
see Darrell Henderson

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:48.757
because he is having a
surprisingly great season.

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:51.593
I don't think people know
about it, especially Madden.

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:53.595
And we're gonna get those ratings up.

00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:54.846
And I think he's here now.

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:55.930
Let's go talk to him.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:59.017
[Instrumental music]

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:04.773
Hey, look at you getting ready!

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:05.648
- What up?
- How are you living?

00:01:05.648 --> 00:01:07.650
- I'm good. How are you doing?

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:11.488
- I'm enjoying this L.A. air
right now. This is beautiful.

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:14.157
What's not beautiful
is your Madden rating.

00:01:14.157 --> 00:01:18.036
It's bull crap. And I don't let—you're a 73.

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:19.412
- I don't know what's going on, but.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:20.663
- Do you think you're underrated?

00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:22.916
- I do. Like, I've been
underrated my whole life,

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.042
so it's--
- All right.

00:01:24.042 --> 00:01:25.335
Well, we're gonna do some stuff today

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:28.505
to get that rating up.
- Let's get it.
- OK?

00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:30.298
You sure?
- I'm ready.

00:01:30.298 --> 00:01:31.800
- OK. I got a guy named Clint.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.426
He's the guy we have to talk to, OK?

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:35.261
- All right.
- Let's get this going.

00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:37.347
There he is.

00:01:37.347 --> 00:01:39.099
Clint, my buddy, old pal!

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:40.475
How you feeling, buddy?

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:42.894
- Hey, I'm good. How're you doing, Lefkoe?

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:45.688
- I'm good. This is my good
friend, Darrell Henderson.

00:01:45.688 --> 00:01:47.440
You may know him. He's on the Rams.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:49.692
He's having an incredible
season this year.

00:01:49.692 --> 00:01:51.736
- Yes, I know who Darrell is.

00:01:51.736 --> 00:01:52.570
How you doing, Darrell?

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:53.404
Nice to see you.

00:01:53.404 --> 00:01:54.364
- I'm doing good. How you doing?

00:01:54.364 --> 00:01:56.574
- Doing well. What can
I do for you guys today?

00:01:56.574 --> 00:01:57.784
- I've told him you're the plug.

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:59.410
And I wanna fix two ratings.

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:00.787
I wanna make them sky high

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:03.206
cuz I think my man is
killing it this season.

00:02:03.206 --> 00:02:06.000
First one: Ball Carrier Vision.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.460
Where is he right now?

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.879
And what do I need to have
him show you to bump it up?

00:02:09.879 --> 00:02:13.842
- So his Ball Carrier Vision
rating currently is at 77.
- [Lefkoe:] Mmm.

00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:16.052
- [Clint Oldenburg:] Currently ranking him 107.
- Ooh.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.639
- [Lefkoe:] Do you think my friend is blind?

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:21.724
- Man, they got the practice
squads in front of me?

00:02:21.724 --> 00:02:23.601
- Yeah, practice squad's in front of him.

00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:25.186
What's the deal, Clint?

00:02:25.186 --> 00:02:27.063
- That's mainly because we don't have

00:02:27.063 --> 00:02:29.107
a ton of reps on Darrell yet,

00:02:29.107 --> 00:02:31.276
but things that we're looking
for in Ball Carrier Vision,

00:02:31.276 --> 00:02:34.445
uh, speed at which you find cutback lanes,

00:02:34.445 --> 00:02:38.158
yardage efficiency, getting
through holes quickly.

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:40.243
Just maximizing that
burst through the line,

00:02:40.243 --> 00:02:41.911
which I know is one of
Darrell's strengths.

00:02:41.911 --> 00:02:43.079
- The second thing is

00:02:43.079 --> 00:02:46.249
apparently my guy has
an absolute arm cannon.

00:02:46.249 --> 00:02:48.751
I wanna focus on Throw Power.

00:02:48.751 --> 00:02:49.586
- [Oldenburg:] That's a great question.

00:02:49.586 --> 00:02:51.462
I don't hear that one
much for running backs.

00:02:51.462 --> 00:02:54.716
I can give you a pretty
sizable increase in Throw Power

00:02:54.716 --> 00:02:57.218
if you could throw over 60 yards.

00:02:57.218 --> 00:02:58.303
- Easy.
- [Lefkoe:] Mmm.

00:02:58.303 --> 00:03:00.597
I'm gonna have him do
all the things you asked.

00:03:00.597 --> 00:03:02.056
We're gonna send you the footage.

00:03:02.056 --> 00:03:03.683
You're gonna bump up the ratings.

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:05.226
And we're all gonna be smiles.

00:03:05.226 --> 00:03:06.477
I appreciate you, Clint.

00:03:06.477 --> 00:03:08.188
- [Oldenburg:] OK, I can't wait to see it, guys.

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:09.230
- OK.

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:12.150
Now that he's off the
phone, let's smoke this,

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:12.984
OK?
- We got to.

00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:14.819
- Yes, let's go!
- [Laughing]

00:03:14.819 --> 00:03:17.906
[Instrumental music]

00:03:18.907 --> 00:03:20.408
- [Lefkoe:] It is Throw Power time.

00:03:20.408 --> 00:03:22.368
You feel a little cocky
about this, don't you?

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:24.037
- No, I'm just confident.

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:24.996
- He's just confident.

00:03:24.996 --> 00:03:26.080
Let me bring it down to size

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:29.500
because we are comparing it
to your Madden character.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.669
Have you seen yourself
throw in Madden yet?

00:03:31.669 --> 00:03:33.046
- No.
- It's not a pretty sight.

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:34.547
Let's take a look.

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:37.675
There he is: 27, Darrell
Henderson. Drops back, throws,

00:03:38.676 --> 00:03:40.553
and that's about as far as you can throw.

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:42.055
40 yards, Darrell Henderson.

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:44.307
Is that insulting to
who you are as a person?

00:03:44.307 --> 00:03:45.141
- Yes.

00:03:45.141 --> 00:03:46.517
- I'm insulted for you.

00:03:46.517 --> 00:03:49.646
If you throw it further than
40, your rating goes up.

00:03:49.646 --> 00:03:52.607
The further you go, the higher it goes up.

00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:53.441
- Then let's go.

00:03:53.441 --> 00:03:55.985
- OK. Get this out of
here. It's bad evidence.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.572
[Instrumental music]

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:00.531
Are you ready?

00:04:00.531 --> 00:04:01.366
- Let's go.
- [Lefkoe:] OK.

00:04:01.366 --> 00:04:05.286
[Instrumental music continues]

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.791
Darrell, there is no way
your Madden character

00:04:09.791 --> 00:04:11.417
is throwing that far.
[Beep]

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:15.338
[Instrumental music continues]

00:04:16.464 --> 00:04:18.967
Look at Darrell with the beautiful throw!
[Beep]

00:04:18.967 --> 00:04:20.343
I think that was further.

00:04:20.343 --> 00:04:21.427
Does that feel good?

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:22.262
- Yeah.

00:04:29.727 --> 00:04:30.937
- [Lefkoe:] Oh, that's the one.

00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:32.605
[Beep]

00:04:32.605 --> 00:04:35.191
I gotta do some pushups.
This is intimidating.

00:04:35.191 --> 00:04:37.402
All right, this is the last one.

00:04:37.402 --> 00:04:38.820
Do you think you can hit 70?

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:39.654
- Let's go.

00:04:39.654 --> 00:04:42.657
[Suspenseful music]

00:04:47.453 --> 00:04:50.164
- [Lefkoe:] Get there, get there, get
there, get there, get there.

00:04:50.164 --> 00:04:51.499
What did it hit, Jacob?

00:04:51.499 --> 00:04:52.709
- [Jacob:] 11.

00:04:52.709 --> 00:04:54.377
- The 11!
[Beep]

00:04:54.377 --> 00:04:55.461
69!

00:04:56.713 --> 00:04:58.006
How does the cannon feel?

00:04:58.006 --> 00:04:58.840
- Good.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:01.592
- Man, see, and this is why
his ratings need to go up.

00:05:01.592 --> 00:05:04.345
Because he is willing to tire out his arm

00:05:04.345 --> 00:05:06.514
in a game week for "Underrated."

00:05:06.514 --> 00:05:08.599
OK, so we know that you can throw it,

00:05:08.599 --> 00:05:11.102
but if we're really gonna
change your Madden rating,

00:05:11.102 --> 00:05:14.105
I need to see the vision,
that Ball Carrier Vision.

00:05:14.105 --> 00:05:15.732
We don't have your offensive line,

00:05:15.732 --> 00:05:17.483
but I do have these guys.

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:20.570
[Instrumental music]

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:23.239
So here's how we're gonna do this.

00:05:23.239 --> 00:05:25.616
I'm getting under center.
I'm bringing it back.

00:05:25.616 --> 00:05:28.411
And when you get the rock,
they're gonna open up.

00:05:28.411 --> 00:05:30.663
Wherever the hole is, hit it

00:05:30.663 --> 00:05:33.166
and then juke out the linebacker cam.

00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:35.376
Does this sound good to you?

00:05:35.376 --> 00:05:36.919
- I'm with it. I'm ready.

00:05:36.919 --> 00:05:38.421
- Let's go.

00:05:38.421 --> 00:05:41.257
[Instrumental music]

00:05:41.257 --> 00:05:42.091
- [Lefkoe:] OK.
Set!

00:05:44.177 --> 00:05:48.681
Darrell Henderson. Hike!
Hey!

00:05:55.229 --> 00:05:57.315
I think we need to embarrass the camera.

00:05:57.315 --> 00:05:59.484
I think whatever you
do on this next move,

00:05:59.484 --> 00:06:01.319
just embarrass it.

00:06:02.737 --> 00:06:04.572
Underrated. Lefkoe!

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:06.532
Hot route.

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:09.619
Darrell Henderson. Hike!

00:06:09.619 --> 00:06:12.705
[Instrumental music]

00:06:16.376 --> 00:06:17.210
[Laughing]

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:19.796
I'm worried that the camera's exploded.

00:06:19.796 --> 00:06:24.217
Madden, I mean, we're breaking
cameras to improve this rating.

00:06:24.217 --> 00:06:26.969
Man.
- Stiff-armed it down there.
- [Lefkoe:] Ahh!

00:06:26.969 --> 00:06:28.721
All right, this is the last one.

00:06:28.721 --> 00:06:31.891
EA, Clint: This is a big one.

00:06:31.891 --> 00:06:34.894
Oldenburg! Clint Oldenburg!

00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:39.565
Darrell Henderson! Hike!

00:06:39.565 --> 00:06:41.234
Way to be, Darrell!

00:06:43.027 --> 00:06:45.446
All you did was break a camera today.

00:06:45.446 --> 00:06:47.323
Proud of you. How did it feel?

00:06:47.323 --> 00:06:48.241
- It felt pretty good.

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:49.325
- All right, tell the people first:

00:06:49.325 --> 00:06:50.618
How are my handoff skills?

00:06:50.618 --> 00:06:51.911
- It was great.

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:53.371
- Except when I went that way, right?

00:06:53.371 --> 00:06:54.414
- Yeah, you had a little difficulty at the beginning.

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:56.332
- That's OK.

00:06:56.332 --> 00:06:58.918
Offensive line was
great. You threw it deep.

00:06:58.918 --> 00:07:01.337
Showed off the arm cannon.

00:07:01.337 --> 00:07:04.298
Overall, do you have a
message for the people of EA?

00:07:04.298 --> 00:07:06.884
- Get my ratings up.
Stop playing with me.

00:07:06.884 --> 00:07:07.844
- Stop playing with him.

00:07:07.844 --> 00:07:10.263
Darrell Henderson. Get
the ratings up now!

00:07:11.305 --> 00:07:14.392
[Instrumental music]

00:07:15.268 --> 00:07:19.063
- Clint, buddy, pal, I've missed you a lot.

00:07:19.063 --> 00:07:21.899
And I'm so excited
because Darrell Henderson

00:07:21.899 --> 00:07:24.944
is showing everybody this
season he's the most underrated.

00:07:24.944 --> 00:07:26.863
I know you see the stiff-arms.

00:07:26.863 --> 00:07:28.322
- He is coming up, man.

00:07:29.449 --> 00:07:31.617
I wish the Rams would commit
to him a little bit more.

00:07:31.617 --> 00:07:33.119
Get him more carries in that backfield.

00:07:33.119 --> 00:07:35.163
But he is opening some eyes for sure.

00:07:35.163 --> 00:07:36.164
- I'm lovin' it.

00:07:36.164 --> 00:07:38.416
And now I need you to say this to his face,

00:07:38.416 --> 00:07:39.250
that he's underrated.

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:41.252
Let's get Darrell Henderson on the call.

00:07:42.879 --> 00:07:44.672
My guy!

00:07:44.672 --> 00:07:46.132
Darrell, I mean, listen.

00:07:46.132 --> 00:07:48.050
Ever since I've seen,
you've been killing people, dude.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:49.719
It's amazing to watch, man.

00:07:49.719 --> 00:07:51.095
We're proud of ya.

00:07:51.095 --> 00:07:52.096
- Appreciate it.

00:07:52.096 --> 00:07:55.433
- Clint, first thing, Throw Power.

00:07:55.433 --> 00:07:57.518
- Oh, my gosh, so that was impressive.

00:07:57.518 --> 00:07:59.854
I didn't know that he had
an arm on him like this.

00:07:59.854 --> 00:08:02.815
He threw it almost 70 yards
in the air on both throws.

00:08:02.815 --> 00:08:07.445
So his Throw Power is actually
going up 22 points to a 55,

00:08:07.445 --> 00:08:11.115
and he's now the fourth
running back in Throw Power,

00:08:11.115 --> 00:08:12.825
right below a teammate of his,

00:08:12.825 --> 00:08:15.036
who was a former quarterback, Cam Akers.

00:08:15.036 --> 00:08:16.746
- Yeah, we might have to have a throw-off

00:08:16.746 --> 00:08:18.498
in the Rams backfield here.

00:08:18.498 --> 00:08:21.834
Clint, we got the sumo
wrestlers out there,

00:08:21.834 --> 00:08:25.338
the offensive line for
some Ball Carrier Vision.

00:08:25.338 --> 00:08:28.758
Was the tape good enough
to improve that for you?

00:08:28.758 --> 00:08:30.593
- Darrell was already increasing

00:08:30.593 --> 00:08:32.428
based on his game film this season.

00:08:32.428 --> 00:08:35.014
It is now going up to an 80.

00:08:35.014 --> 00:08:38.267
He's gonna now be ranked
63rd among all running backs

00:08:38.267 --> 00:08:39.352
in Ball Carrier Vision.

00:08:39.352 --> 00:08:42.396
So he's moved up 44 spots
in Ball Carrier Vision

00:08:42.396 --> 00:08:43.648
since we last spoke.

00:08:43.648 --> 00:08:45.191
- Darrell, your thoughts.

00:08:45.191 --> 00:08:49.529
- We're off to a good start,
but I think I'm about a 92.

00:08:49.529 --> 00:08:51.239
[Laughing]

00:08:51.239 --> 00:08:52.323
- That's not all.

00:08:52.323 --> 00:08:56.285
Based on the tape, there's
a bonus point.
- Hey.
- Awareness.

00:08:56.285 --> 00:08:58.538
Awareness is also going up one point.

00:08:58.538 --> 00:09:00.748
That will raise your
overall rating, Darrell.

00:09:00.748 --> 00:09:03.042
So you've moved up to a 75 overall

00:09:03.042 --> 00:09:04.544
with all of these updates.

00:09:04.544 --> 00:09:05.670
- Let's go!
- Ooh.

00:09:07.004 --> 00:09:08.798
I'm saying you're underrated.

00:09:08.798 --> 00:09:11.842
Social media is saying you're underrated.

00:09:11.842 --> 00:09:15.805
Clint, is Darrell Henderson underrated?

00:09:15.805 --> 00:09:17.515
- Darrell Henderson is underrated,

00:09:17.515 --> 00:09:20.309
and if I could, I wanna make
a plea to Coach Sean McVay:

00:09:20.309 --> 00:09:22.311
Get the ball in this guy's
hands a little bit more.

00:09:22.311 --> 00:09:23.980
I wanna see more of him.

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:28.109
- Yeah, so I gotta keep working,
keep improving, week by week.

00:09:28.109 --> 00:09:30.319
- Darrell, so proud of you.

00:09:30.319 --> 00:09:32.905
And candidly, the only
thing more surprising

00:09:32.905 --> 00:09:35.866
than your phenomenal
performance this year...

00:09:35.866 --> 00:09:37.410
Clint, what is it?

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.244
- Insurance?

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:40.454
- Exactly!

00:09:40.454 --> 00:09:43.499
The surprisingly great
rates of State Farm!

00:09:43.499 --> 00:09:46.460
That's "Underrated" and
that's one heck of a segue.

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:48.796
Darrell Henderson, way to go, pal!

00:09:48.796 --> 00:09:51.882
[Instrumental music]

00:09:57.138 --> 00:09:57.972
[Whistle]

